+# M10.5 · Author results known before public registration
+
+This prospective test concerns the coherent strand of loaded dimers. The applicant used three board sizes while developing the material and its spatial reader. OpenWave has a separate decision on admission of this state and decoder, and any formal acquisition uses a distinct public selector domain. A result in the table below is an author simulation on the staged implementation. [Proposed source and executable terms](https://github.com/FloatingPragma/observer-patch-holography/tree/92370140edfbdb0ac2be647b2b8166d821e5f1a2/model/candidate_laws/interval_echo/openwave/row_30_collective/confirmation)
+
+| Version and cohort | Selectors for 20, 80 and 320 cells | Complete decision |
+| --- | --- | --- |
+| v2 exposed pilot | 927016 at each size | Three boards passed. |
+| v2 local validation | 374621, 614357, 801173 | The 80- and 320-cell recurrence wavelengths failed their held receiver profiles. All 130 count arrays were present. The three-board verdict was rejected. |
+| v3 exposed pilot and repeat | Both groups above, with their original counts | All six boards passed when wave numbers from even holds were used throughout. These results helped choose the decoder. |
+| v3 local validation | 785029, 514823, 690271 | All three boards passed after the source and numerical terms were fixed. All 170 count arrays were retained. |
+
+In v3 the receiver wave numbers are fitted on even holds and scored on odd holds. On the three v3 validation boards the weighted residuals were 422.56, 860.42 and 786.58. The ceilings were 554.07, 1137.74 and 963.37. Replacing the measured wavelengths with the launch labels on those same counts gave 2,786,515, 792,450 and 1,794,431. The lattice forecast from two disjoint coupling measurements agreed with 22 frequencies within 0.000575 in dimer-clock units. Fourteen low-wave-number lines agreed with the continuum approximation within 0.003165. On the original long-wavelength pilot a matched parabola also passed the continuum tolerance. Sensitivity to the two shapes comes from the wider lattice band. Each of the three v3 cohorts replayed from its saved binding and selectors.
+
+To reproduce the archived v3 validation, set `OPENBLAS_NUM_THREADS=1`, `VECLIB_MAXIMUM_THREADS=1` and `OMP_NUM_THREADS=1` before starting Python. On the review host, one default-thread inspection changed the 80-cell recurrence diagnostic from 1467.5798844872443 to 1467.5798844158894. This exceeded the frozen absolute replay tolerance of 10⁻⁸ and the verifier returned `invalid` (4). A fresh one-thread replay reproduced all 170 count arrays and passed the scientific gates.
+
+The separate closed-ring experiment uses a different preparation and two local measurement ensembles. It contributes no open-strand public trial. An award would concern a prepared, one-dimensional collective matter mode with unread coherent connectors. Official acceptance and the official held experiment are independent of this author evidence.
